ivesMatter","userId":1604931252,"media":null,"username":"Blklivesmatter","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":197,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":9.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1017861661703618560,"date":1531512105000,"rawContent":"The impetus for that commitment was, and still is, the rampant and deliberate violence inflicted on us by the state. #5YearsofBLM #BlackLivesMatter","userId":1604931252,"media":null,"username":"Blklivesmatter","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":198,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":10.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1017863682410274816,"date":1531512587000,"rawContent":"Enraged by the death of Trayvon Martin and the subsequent acquittal of his killer, George Zimmerman, we took to the streets. #5YearsofBLM #BlackLivesMatter","userId":1604931252,"media":null,"username":"Blklivesmatter","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":199,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":11.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1017866405683724288,"date":1531513236000,"rawContent":"We were inspired by the 31-day takeover of the Florida State Capitol by @PowerU305 and the @Dreamdefenders. #5YearsofBLM #BlackLivesMatter","userId":1604931252,"media":null,"username":"Blklivesmatter","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":fa